@Maintenance.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5164

### MNT-02: list all interventions
GET {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interventions
Accept: application/json

### MNT-02: filter by priority, location and status
GET {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interventions?priority=High&location=King&status=To%20Do
Accept: application/json

### MNT-01: create an intervention (201 Created)
POST {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interventions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Pothole near bus stop",
  "location": "King Street North",
  "issueType": "Road",
  "priority": "High"
}

### MNT-01: missing required fields (400 Bad Request)
POST {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interventions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": ""
}
